title: Glare-Free High Beams (Matrix LED Enable)
raw_community_title: Glare-free headlights
category: Lighting
platform: F-150 Lightning
model_years: 2022-2026
trim: All
validated: true
verified_by: Kyle / AsBuiltPro & Lightning Community
source_sheet: F-150 Lightning FORScan Thread
notes: Enhances Auto High Beam behavior to provide localized dimming of brights based
  on surrounding traffic. Dynamic bending lights continue to work. May take a couple
  of restarts to take effect. Specific to Lightnings. Ensure no checksum DTCs are
  set for the HCM.
steps:
- module: APIM
  address: 7D0-09-01
  mask: x*xx xxxx xx--
  nibbles:
  - nibble: 1
    recommended_hex: '1'
    community_instruction: Set to 1
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 0
      feature_name: Adjustable Speed Limiter Device  (ASLD)
      target_state: Disabled
    - bit: 2
      action: 0
      feature_name: AdvanceTrac Control Function (ATCF)
      target_state: Disabled
    - bit: 1
      action: 0
      feature_name: Auto High Beam Control Function (AHBCF)
      target_state: Disabled
    - bit: 0
      action: 1
      feature_name: Autolamp Delay (AD)
      target_state: Enabled
- module: APIM
  address: 7D0-09-03
  mask: xx*x xxxx xx--
  nibbles:
